  "body": "Either of these pages:\r\n* https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/named-characters.html#named-character-references\r\n* https://www.w3.org/TR/html5/syntax.html#named-character-references\r\n\r\ntells me:\r\n* &amp;rarrpl; is U+02945; this is &rarrpl; [RIGHTWARDS ARROW WITH PLUS BELOW](https://www.fileformat.info/info/unicode/char/2945/)\r\n* &amp;larrpl; is U+02939; this is &larrpl; [LEFT-SIDE ARC ANTICLOCKWISE ARROW](https://www.fileformat.info/info/unicode/char/2939/)\r\n\r\nCompare U+02946: this is &#x2946; [LEFTWARDS ARROW WITH PLUS BELOW](https://www.fileformat.info/info/unicode/char/2946/)\r\nThis seems a far better fit for &amp;larrpl; !\r\n",
